296441988", "personaname": "poopy sniffer", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198296441988/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 135308, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 132359, "last_played": 1735516669, "avatar": "905e79443be93e55772b518e8f81fde1d9b3fcb0"}, "language": "english", "review": "Got PERMA HARDWARE BANNED for one and only one verbal offence. Called another player a \"gamer\" word after they greifed our mission and caused us to fail. Got reported and one week later and couldnt login again. I then tried to appeal it but they said no. I have played this game for over 7 years and spent hundreds of dollars on it and never would have thought I could get irreversibly banned for saying a 6 letter word one time. If you play this game just remember that you are on thin ice. DE is known for having a problem with banning. At the end of the day it is just a video game but I cant help but to feel disappointed and betrayed. Save your time and money... get a job", "timestamp_created": 1726444463, "timestamp_updated": 1726444463, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 5, "votes_funny": 5, "weighted_vote_score": "0.511035621166229248", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 19, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 1, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 3, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 5, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "175060927", "author": {"steamid": "76561198042637761", "personaname": "Endgraven", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198042637761/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 23, "playtime_forever": 18920, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 442, "playtime_at_review": 5099, "last_played": 1789001737, "avatar": "14f1a9927382fa8dea134a0f3ca6f17e6938e131"},